<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνύ̆χ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνυξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			, <i>small claw,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				503a29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pig's
				<i>trotters,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				1941
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1259.37
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> an eyedisease, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνυξ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				111.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMed.Strassb.</u>
				p.6
			</span></i> K.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκόρδων ὀνύχια</span>
			<i>cloves</i> of garlic, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνυξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111.4
				</span></i>
			) a kind of <i>onyx,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				28.20
			</span></i> : as Adj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνύχιος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
